     <TextBlock x:Name="MythPingHint" Text="Use your numeric Discord User ID, not your username. In Discord: Settings → Advanced → Developer Mode, then right-click your profile → Copy User ID. Text is still included in the alert, but cannot create a Discord ping." Foreground="#777280" FontSize="11" Margin="0,10,0,24" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
