     <TextBlock Text="Automatic worker discovery" FontWeight="SemiBold"/><TextBlock Text="Open a worker in each RDP session. This controller finds and pairs matching twist workers on this computer." Foreground="#85858F" FontSize="11" Margin="0,8,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
